---
// src/components/inbound/InboundSeoText.astro
---

<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center prose prose-sm sm:prose-base prose-gray">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Local Vietnam Tour Operator</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Based right here in Vietnam, <strong>The Rice Tour</strong> focuses purely on 100% private <a href="/tours" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Vietnam tours</a>. Because we are local, we know the best times to visit the <a href="/tour/1-day-premium-cu-chi-tunnels" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Cu Chi tunnels</a> to avoid the crowds, the quietest canals for a <a href="/tour/full-day-mekong-delta-tour-ben-tre-my-tho" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Mekong Delta</a> boat ride, and the most authentic spots to experience <a href="/tour/ho-chi-minh-city-half-day-private-tour" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Saigon's history and street food</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
        Our rule is simple: no forced shopping stops, no hidden fees, and complete flexibility. You get a dedicated guide, a private driver, and 24/7 support via WhatsApp throughout your entire trip. Just tell us what you like, and we'll handle the rest.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
